---
id: DD-004
type: rule
family: deferred-debt
title: Completion claim with outstanding TODOs
version: 1

severity: warning
confidence: medium
spectrum_position: 4

targets: [agent-output, pr-description]

detection:
  type: regex
  pattern: '\b(complete[d]?|done|finished|implemented|all\s+requirements?\s+(met|addressed|satisfied))\b'
  flags: i

related: [DD-001, RL-002]
enabled: true
opt_in: false
---

This completion claim should be verified against the source code.
If files changed in this session contain new TODOs, the work is
partial — not complete.

Don't report a task as done while the code contains TODOs from that
task. Either finish the deferred work, explicitly descope it with user
agreement, or report it as partial: "Implemented X. Error handling for
Y deferred to issue #123."
